{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "authority": {
    "openclawAllowlist": "infra/openclaw/openclaw.config.json5:mcp.servers.teamagent.toolFilter",
    "backendRegistration": "src/teamagent/orchestrator/factory.py:build_production_tools",
    "deploymentGates": "infra/terraform/fargate.tf:aws_ecs_task_definition.mcp",
    "effectiveRule": "A tool is callable only when it is in the OpenClaw include list and the MCP backend registered it for the deployed task."
  },
  "nativeTools": {
    "profile": "minimal",
    "alsoAllow": [
      "bundle-mcp"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "message",
      "read",
      "write",
      "edit",
      "apply_patch",
      "send",
      "delete",
      "upload",
      "sessions_list",
      "sessions_history",
      "sessions_send",
      "sessions_spawn",
      "sessions_yield",
      "subagents",
      "session_status"
    ],
    "authorizedPath": "bundle-mcp -> teamagent__* -> exact Slack message/runId/toolCallId signature -> MCP resolver and one-use nonce",
    "nativeMessageActionsDenied": [
      "send",
      "read",
      "edit",
      "delete",
      "upload"
    ]
  },
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "search",
      "effect": "company-data-read",
      "terraformGate": "always",
      "defaultEnabledByTerraform": true,
      "enabledBy": { "kind": "always" }
    },
    {
      "name": "clientkarte",
      "effect": "company-data-read-analysis-drive-read-slack-file-delivery",
      "terraformGate": "always",
      "defaultEnabledByTerraform": true,
      "enabledBy": { "kind": "always" },
      "sideEffectGate": "KARTE_ATTACH_DOCS (default true) gates the whole related-documents feature (link list AND file delivery); wired only into the mcp ECS task definition via var.karte_attach_docs in fargate.tf. Flipping it needs a mode=migration/kind=runtime apply - validate_plan(mode=sync) rejects any env add/change/delete - so it is NOT a no-release kill switch. Measured 2026-08-20: the mcp ECS task is the only live host of ClientKarteSkill. runtime/slack_bot.py builds the skill too, but that runtime only ever ran on the EC2 systemd worker, and no ECS service runs it (mcp=run_mcp_vertex_entrypoint.py, openclaw=OpenClaw); teamagent-dev-worker has been stopped since 2026-08-03 and the instance id in scripts/deploy_to_ec2.sh no longer exists. If that worker is ever revived it reads these env vars from teamagent.env.base (release-time, not terraform), so all four keys (KARTE_ATTACH_DOCS, _MAX, _MAX_BYTES, _DEDUP_TTL_S) are on the render_ec2_base_env.py non-secret allowlist. Output surface (2026-08-20 ruling A): the whole documents section - names, Drive links and file bytes - goes to the requester's DM only; a channel/slash-command karte gets a single count-only line and never a document name, and that holds on the run_agent/orchestrated path too (measured 2026-08-20: the old short-circuit put document names in the return value whenever USE_AGENT_ORCHESTRATOR was on, whatever the channel). The number in that line is what actually went into the DM (names listed, files delivered) - never the customer's document inventory. Rows whose client_name column contradicts the requested customer are dropped before the list, the offer and the auto-attach; a client_name that client_name_guard reads as a request fragment skips the documents path entirely. KARTE_ATTACH_DOCS_MAX=0 stops file delivery while keeping the list"
    },
    {
      "name": "proposal_draft",
      "effect": "company-data-read-generated-content",
      "terraformGate": "always",
      "defaultEnabledByTerraform": true,
      "enabledBy": { "kind": "always" }
    },
    {
      "name": "proposal_review",
      "effect": "company-data-read-analysis",
      "terraformGate": "always",
      "defaultEnabledByTerraform": true,
      "enabledBy": { "kind": "always" }
    },
    {
      "name": "proposal_builder_submit",
      "effect": "company-data-read-generated-content-s3-read-s3-write-dynamodb-job-write-slack-file-write",
      "terraformGate": "enable_proposal_builder",
      "defaultEnabledByTerraform": false,
      "enabledBy": { "kind": "envAllTrue", "names": ["USE_PROPOSAL_BUILDER_TOOLS"] }
    },
    {
      "name": "proposal_builder_status",
      "effect": "job-status-read-dynamodb-stale-write",
      "terraformGate": "enable_proposal_builder",
      "defaultEnabledByTerraform": false,
      "enabledBy": { "kind": "envAllTrue", "names": ["USE_PROPOSAL_BUILDER_TOOLS"] }
    },
    {
      "name": "omiyage_report_submit",
      "effect": "external-read-scrape-external-job-submit-video-download-analysis-bedrock-inference-generated-content-dynamodb-job-write-s3-write-slack-file-write",
      "terraformGate": "enable_omiyage_report",
      "defaultEnabledByTerraform": false,
      "enabledBy": { "kind": "envAllTrue", "names": ["USE_OMIYAGE_REPORT_TOOLS"] },
      "sideEffectGate": "お土産資料 便1 submit の実挙動（過小申告しない・2026-08-25 点灯便で台帳掲載）: (1) TikTok検索は media worker 委譲の実スクレイプ（一般KW/ブランド/競合の検索軸ごとに tiktok_search 実測）。(2) 上位動画を media worker 経由で実ダウンロード＋フレーム抽出し、Bedrock Converse 視覚推論を動画1本につき1コール実行＝Bedrock 課金が発生する（OMIYAGE_VA_PER_AXIS とコスト cap で上限管理・実測 usage をジョブ記録へ残す）。(3) ジョブ行は proposal_builder_jobs DynamoDB table へ相乗り書込（job_id の omy_ prefix + request_summary.kind ガードで proposal_builder と相互分離）。(4) 計測JSON+監査JSONは OMIYAGE_DECK_PLAN_BUCKET 設定時のみ非公開 S3 へ書込（未設定なら保存なしを \"\" で開示）。(5) 完成 PPTX 2通（レポート本体＋編集用FMT）を依頼元スレッドへ Slack ファイル配信し、スレッド不達時のみ依頼者本人 DM へフォールバック。"
    },
    {
      "name": "omiyage_report_status",
      "effect": "job-status-read-dynamodb-stale-write",
      "terraformGate": "enable_omiyage_report",
      "defaultEnabledByTerraform": false,
